cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use zer0lint, please cite it as below."
title: "zer0lint: fact-survival checks and mem0 extraction-prompt comparison"
abstract: >-
  zer0lint injects synthetic facts into a compatible mem0 or HTTP memory backend
  and checks whether they survive an add/search round trip. For a local mem0
  config, it compares a technical-fact extraction prompt and can apply it after
  a successful re-test.
type: software
version: 0.4.0
authors:
